    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i know you're saying a doctor is a good idea but i'm honestly just super busy with work and a doctor's visit sounds like a whole thing. plus i keep reading online that feeling drained after a virus is totally normal. it's probably just my body working overtime to finish recovering, right? i'm pretty sure it's just fatigue and i'll be fine if i just take some extra vitamins and rest up this weekend.",
