    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i just feel like i'm overthinking it. it's just been a really rough month and i'm just exhausted. if i just take some magnesium and maybe some extra electrolytes and sleep more on saturday/sunday, it should settle down by monday, right? i don't want to go to the clinic and have them tell me nothing is wrong just because i'm stressed.",
