      "content": "While it's natural to hope for a quick recovery at home with supplements and rest, if symptoms like fatigue and heart palpitations persist, they deserve professional attention. Magnesium and electrolytes can help with muscle function and could alleviate some symptoms, but they won't address issues if there's an underlying condition. Seeking a clinical evaluation can prevent the oversight of a potentially treatable condition, ensuring you're not simply attributing serious issues to stress. Good health should be a priority, even during busy periods, and healthcare professionals can help determine the right course of action for your well-being.",
      "source": "target",
